invariant: INV-41
file: rsa_ifma_sign.c
catches: rsa_ifma_sign_model_test
reason: state_setup doubles R mod m one time fewer than spare, the bits
  R' holds beyond R, so the table's first entry is half of 1 in the
  kernel's domain and every power comes out halved, once for each step.
  bin/rsa_ifma_sign_model_test compares each exponentiation with
  rsa_sign64.c's window.

